WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.525
Lab 1 needs only PowerShell 7
with Pester, in the kit's folder.

2
00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:09.361
Between the two weeks, Contoso's platform
team switched the WAF to prevention,

3
00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:14.423
moved the firewall to deny, routed a subnet
to the firewall, added a missing header,

4
00:00:14.423 --> 00:00:19.184
turned on purge protection, enforced
the security initiative and required

5
00:00:19.184 --> 00:00:21.828
authorization for new management groups;

6
00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:24.775
a new public IP appeared
and an orphan went away.

7
00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:29.713
Step 1 runs every area on week
one: forty-eight findings in all.

8
00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:34.503
Step 2 reads the policy findings:
an assignment with excluded scopes,

9
00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:40.050
an exemption expired on October 31, one
with no expiry, one due within thirty days,

10
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:44.980
and the initiative still in audit
after its November 1 enforce-by date.
